**Evaluation for the K3D Automatic RLWHF Training Program:**

**Student Response Analysis:**  
The student provided a code snippet that attempts to sum elements within "snowflakes" (arrays of numbers) but contains a critical logic error. The code incorrectly sums the first six elements of the snowflake array instead of iterating over each snowflake to sum their internal elements. The explanation acknowledges handling large numbers but fails to address the structural requirement of processing each snowflake individually.

